WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:03.300
Where does your API collection live?

00:03.367 --> 00:09.933
In your repo.
Collections stored as code.

00:10.067 --> 00:16.533
Plain-text files you can read.

00:16.667 --> 00:23.167
Branch it. Diff it. Review it. Merge it.

00:23.300 --> 00:29.767
An API client, not a platform.

00:29.900 --> 00:36.400
The same files run in your terminal and CI.

00:36.533 --> 00:43.033
No cloud sync. No account. No login.

00:43.167 --> 00:49.667
Bruno
The Git-native API client.
usebruno.com
